    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-02.t05",
      "en": "Tom was nervous because he had never played that song at a concert before.",
      "es": "Tom estaba nervioso porque nunca había tocado esa canción en un concierto.",
      "explanationEs": "Had never + participio + before: era la primera vez en ese momento.",
      "segments": [
